  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">POL Pension reform - Pension reform 3</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">POL Pension reform</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Experthj&#xE4;lp och teknisk assistans i en reform av &#xE5;lderspensions- systemet i Polen efter de linjer som utarbetats i Sverige. Samarbetet syftar bl a p&#xE5; att ytterligare f&#xF6;rfina datormodellen och studera de l&#xE5;ngsiktiga effekterna av olika l&#xF6;sningar av pensioner, reformera systemet f&#xF6;r f&#xF6;rtidspensioner, vidareutbilda personalen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support of the institutional and technical capabilities of the Govern-ment in Poland towards implementation of a fundamental reform of its old-age, disability and survivor pension system. The cooperation will i.a. aid in the technical work to support the reform legislation by further the development of the Technical Model.</narrative>
  </description>
